{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Calling All Soldiers!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Blueberry Army awakens to discover that their beloved Chef Lupe is missing, putting their pancake breakfast in jeopardy. It\u2019s up to you to rescue him from the rival Raspberry Army, but it won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Raspberries have prepared their troops and are ready to stop you. Navigate through their various barricades and overcome their skills in mimicry. When you run, they run; when you shoot, they shoot. With only weapons and wits at your disposal, manipulate your opponents to gain the advantage on the battlefield and save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Do you have what it takes to outsmart yourself?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle your way through 18 quirky levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duel against opponents that copy your every move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use special weapons and abilities to gain the upper hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your soldier with unlockable cosmetics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200620?t=1741276921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741276921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200620/0f416e33c66d07d580adc00eaed7d72cc2be2afa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741276921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200620/0f416e33c66d07d580adc00eaed7d72cc2be2afa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741276921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Calling All Soldiers!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Blueberry Army awakens to discover that their beloved Chef Lupe is missing, putting their pancake breakfast in jeopardy. It\u2019s up to you to rescue him from the rival Raspberry Army, but it won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Raspberries have prepared their troops and are ready to stop you. Navigate through their various barricades and overcome their skills in mimicry. When you run, they run; when you shoot, they shoot. With only weapons and wits at your disposal, manipulate your opponents to gain the advantage on the battlefield and save the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Do you have what it takes to outsmart yourself?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle your way through 18 quirky levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duel against opponents that copy your every move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use special weapons and abilities to gain the upper hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your soldier with unlockable cosmetics</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nugget Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200620/header.jpg?t=1741276921","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Nugget Software. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101187,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101187/movie480.mp4?t=1741276920","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101187/movie_max.mp4?t=1741276920"},"name":"Dual Combat - Annoucement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101187/f0785ce48548a3ffe460c2d2b4aa9964f578cc74/m